s\\\":[\\\"The screen passed its actual stability tests; the measured wind benefit is small in the current light wind and does not exclude rain chill.\\\",\\\"Harvesting the plot is a trial, not an assumed success. The remembered wild root stock must also still be available.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Maintain food and energy reserves while pursuing practical mastery.\\\",\\\"Distinguish construction success, measured usefulness, and long-term reliability.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"branch-screen-study\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I personally construct and test a small woven branch windbreak?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Personal study completed at tick 121.\\\",\\\"The post trial at tick 167 seated and retained a branch 0.25 m in ordinary soil.\\\",\\\"Assembly produced screen-168-wren-1870; upright seating and weave retention passed at tick 175.\\\",\\\"At tick 180 the complete screen had integrity 0.96671869.\\\",\\\"At tick 180 the lee-floor measurement recorded windShield 0.35 and avoidedChill 0.00520427, with rainShield zero.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Durability over prolonged weather is untested; the current measurement establishes only a small benefit in light wind, not rain protection or improved rest.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Construct one stable branch screen and observe its actual lee-floor effect.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Learned the method.\\\",\\\"Gathered eleven branch units.\\\",\\\"Passed the post trial.\\\",\\\"Completed assembly and stability checks.\\\",\\\"Observed a measured lee-floor wind-chill reduction.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"screen-168-wren-1870\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"No missing step for this initial construction trial; long-term maintenance remains future work.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Inspect condition before relying on the screen after prolonged weather.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"A stable screen was constructed and a small actual reduction of wind chill was measured.\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"root-cultivation\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I grow meadow roots reliably?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Planting completed at tick 38, producing plot-37-wren-436.\\\",\\\"At tick 121 the plot was established and mature with zero stock.\\\",\\\"At tick 180 the visible mature plot held one root unit, with capacity four.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Harvestable stock is visible, but successful collection and reliability across conditions remain untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Observe establishment and harvest food from one planted root.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Completed one planting at (21,8.65).\\\",\\\"Observed establishment.\\\",\\\"Observed one unit of mature stock.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"plot-37-wren-436\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A successful harvest.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Attempt to gather the single visible root unit.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The planted plot established and subsequently displayed one unit of root stock; no harvest is yet recorded.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}}

